1
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:51,560
Thon, move!

2
00:03:00,200 --> 00:03:02,520
Your time to die has come, Thongdee.

3
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:06,199
<i>There's only one way.</i>

4
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:07,359
You have to kill him.

5
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:09,359
Use Thongdee's Nam Phi iron dagger.

6
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:11,039
Its power can definitely kill him.

7
00:03:11,040 --> 00:03:12,079
Where is the dagger now?

8
00:03:12,080 --> 00:03:13,440
On Men's Ghost Ship.

9
00:03:19,640 --> 00:03:20,520
Whoa.

10
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:23,760
Did you find it, Na?

11
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:27,160
I don't see anything.

12
00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:35,120
There's blood everywhere.

13
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:48,520
What room is this?

14
00:03:50,480 --> 00:03:52,080
Looks like the storage room.

15
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:55,920
The Nam Phi iron dagger
probably isn't in here.

16
00:03:57,200 --> 00:03:58,959
But Ms. Sairung said

17
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:02,280
Mr. Thongdee and Men
fought all over the ship.

18
00:04:02,920 --> 00:04:05,280
I think we should keep looking.

19
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:10,320
Na, there's another room here.

20
00:04:24,080 --> 00:04:25,119
- Da.
- Na.

21
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:27,160
The door is locked from the outside.

22
00:04:28,440 --> 00:04:31,920
What do you mean?
Did someone lock us in here?

23
00:04:33,320 --> 00:04:35,399
What do we do? We can't get out.

24
00:04:35,400 --> 00:04:36,600
I don't know.

25
00:04:38,640 --> 00:04:39,960
That's right, you fools.

26
00:04:40,520 --> 00:04:42,000
It's already too late.

27
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:50,960
Na.

28
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:56,160
What do we do?

29
00:05:02,640 --> 00:05:04,160
Help!

30
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:29,680
Mr. Narathon.

31
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:32,920
I found the Nam Phi iron dagger.

32
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:38,960
Where is it?

33
00:05:40,160 --> 00:05:41,560
In this room.

34
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:46,920
How do you know
it's the Nam Phi iron dagger?

35
00:05:48,760 --> 00:05:50,280
Its power is terrifying.

36
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:53,440
I couldn't even get close to it.

37
00:05:54,160 --> 00:05:56,200
I need you two to retrieve it.

38
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:06,880
I'll go in myself.

39
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:09,480
You wait outside.

40
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:14,960
I'm coming with you.
We can search faster together.

41
00:06:17,680 --> 00:06:18,840
I'm worried about you.

42
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:22,400
I'm worried about you too.

43
00:06:23,280 --> 00:06:26,440
Since we're both worried about each other,
let's go in together.

44
00:06:27,080 --> 00:06:28,800
We can help each other
if something happens.

45
00:06:36,400 --> 00:06:37,400
Alright.

46
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:50,960
It's in here.

47
00:07:14,440 --> 00:07:17,199
If you love each other that much,

48
00:07:17,200 --> 00:07:19,000
then you can die together in there.

49
00:07:41,400 --> 00:07:43,440
Sairung tricked us.

50
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:46,560
What are we going to do?

51
00:07:49,280 --> 00:07:50,360
Are you scared?

52
00:07:53,240 --> 00:07:56,680
As long as you're with me,
I'm not scared of anything.

53
00:07:57,400 --> 00:07:58,760
Trust me.

54
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:02,920
I'll find a way to get you out of here.

55
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,040
Okay.

56
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:19,919
I've searched everywhere around here.
I couldn't find it.

57
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:22,960
Same here. Let's check somewhere else.

58
00:08:23,640 --> 00:08:24,840
Sarai.

59
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:28,799
Your father...

60
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:30,560
What happened to my father?

61
00:08:31,080 --> 00:08:33,960
Men found out he betrayed him

62
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:38,840
by letting all of you board the ship.
He's about to kill your father.

63
00:08:40,159 --> 00:08:42,038
- I'm going to help him.
- I'm coming with you.

64
00:08:42,039 --> 00:08:44,999
Mr. Phum,

65
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:47,999
I think you should keep looking
for the Nam Phi iron dagger.

66
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:49,800
But you can't fight him alone.

67
00:08:50,880 --> 00:08:52,639
Sarai's right.

68
00:08:52,640 --> 00:08:54,719
You have to find the dagger.

69
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:58,480
Pong, Sarai, and I
should be able to hold him off for now.

70
00:08:59,120 --> 00:09:00,440
Hurry up, Sarai.

71
00:09:27,640 --> 00:09:28,640
Dad.

72
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:30,560
Sarai,

73
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:33,240
did you find the Nam Phi iron dagger?

74
00:09:35,200 --> 00:09:37,040
You're alright?

75
00:09:39,880 --> 00:09:41,560
What do you mean?

76
00:09:45,880 --> 00:09:48,280
Sairung, you...

77
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:50,079
Men!

78
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:52,400
Son betrayed you. He's trying to kill you.

79
00:09:59,640 --> 00:10:01,720
Dad! Dad!

80
00:10:04,320 --> 00:10:08,280
Men, Men, listen to me.

81
00:10:11,400 --> 00:10:14,840
Dad! No! Stop!

82
00:10:27,520 --> 00:10:31,039
No!

83
00:10:31,040 --> 00:10:33,440
Anyone who betrays me must die!

84
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:45,520
Let go of me!

85
00:10:49,680 --> 00:10:53,400
I'll imprison your spirit
as my servant forever,

86
00:10:54,080 --> 00:10:55,279
Sarai.

87
00:10:55,280 --> 00:10:59,040
Let go! Let go of me!

88
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:15,680
You two have done well.

89
00:11:16,760 --> 00:11:20,720
Stand guard. Don't let anyone
interrupt my ritual again.

90
00:12:05,960 --> 00:12:06,920
Kaimook.

91
00:12:10,440 --> 00:12:11,440
How are you feeling?

92
00:12:14,960 --> 00:12:17,320
I feel like I can't breathe.

93
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:26,600
Don't give up.

94
00:12:28,680 --> 00:12:30,000
We'll get through this together.

95
00:12:57,760 --> 00:13:00,640
I can hear your heartbeat.

96
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:08,200
It's beating so fast.

97
00:13:17,480 --> 00:13:18,960
Because I'm worried about you.

98
00:13:25,960 --> 00:13:27,520
I promise, Kaimook,

99
00:13:29,760 --> 00:13:32,520
I'll get you out of here.

100
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:39,120
I promise. Don't be afraid.

101
00:13:54,200 --> 00:13:55,920
Have I ever told you...

102
00:14:00,240 --> 00:14:01,840
that I love you?

103
00:14:14,160 --> 00:14:16,240
I love you too, Kaimook.

104
00:14:23,720 --> 00:14:24,720
Kaimook.

105
00:14:27,760 --> 00:14:28,920
Kaimook.

106
00:14:32,280 --> 00:14:33,320
Kaimook.

107
00:14:46,840 --> 00:14:48,280
The Nam Phi iron dagger.

108
00:15:08,600 --> 00:15:11,199
I ask to borrow the Nam Phi iron dagger

109
00:15:11,200 --> 00:15:13,000
to destroy an evil spirit.

110
00:15:13,680 --> 00:15:15,800
I have no intention
of claiming it as my own.

111
00:15:16,760 --> 00:15:19,159
May the rightful owner
of this sacred dagger

112
00:15:19,160 --> 00:15:21,280
grant me blessing and protect me.

113
00:16:14,240 --> 00:16:17,559
I knew someone as smart as you

114
00:16:17,560 --> 00:16:19,000
would find it.

115
00:16:19,960 --> 00:16:21,400
Your plan really is brilliant.

116
00:16:25,040 --> 00:16:27,440
Now, all we have to do is wait.

117
00:16:38,120 --> 00:16:39,920
You dare challenge me?

118
00:17:15,839 --> 00:17:16,760
Sarai.

119
00:17:29,200 --> 00:17:30,640
You damn ghost!

120
00:17:57,520 --> 00:18:00,800
No! Stop!

121
00:19:22,960 --> 00:19:23,920
Mr. Phum!

122
00:19:32,680 --> 00:19:33,720
Mr. Phum.

123
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:46,360
At last, you destroyed each other.

124
00:19:49,040 --> 00:19:51,880
And the winner is me.

125
00:19:56,600 --> 00:19:57,920
Mr. Phum!

126
00:20:02,680 --> 00:20:04,920
Sairung, what are you doing?

127
00:20:06,080 --> 00:20:07,680
I'm getting rid of all of you.

128
00:20:08,640 --> 00:20:09,720
Did you really think

129
00:20:10,480 --> 00:20:14,080
I'd forget what you did to me?

130
00:20:16,600 --> 00:20:18,840
Go spend eternity together in hell.

131
00:20:21,280 --> 00:20:24,640
Stop wasting time. Finish them.

132
00:20:30,280 --> 00:20:31,640
In the end,

133
00:20:33,360 --> 00:20:36,200
you'll die by my hand, Men.

134
00:21:00,120 --> 00:21:01,160
You fool.

135
00:21:04,320 --> 00:21:05,320
Men!

136
00:21:46,280 --> 00:21:48,480
If I die, you're dying with me.

137
00:22:16,920 --> 00:22:18,080
Die now.

138
00:22:19,120 --> 00:22:20,960
No! Mr. Phum!

139
00:22:24,840 --> 00:22:25,680
Mr. Phum.

140
00:22:26,280 --> 00:22:27,199
Pong.

141
00:22:27,200 --> 00:22:28,360
Hey.

142
00:22:32,120 --> 00:22:33,400
What's happening?

143
00:22:45,840 --> 00:22:48,400
- Help me.
- Mr. Phum.

144
00:22:51,200 --> 00:22:54,919
Mr. Phum, you're coming with me.

145
00:22:54,920 --> 00:22:57,079
No. No.

146
00:22:57,080 --> 00:22:58,800
No!

147
00:23:20,320 --> 00:23:21,160
‎Sarai.

148
00:23:40,080 --> 00:23:44,280
Da, it's open. Come on.

149
00:23:50,440 --> 00:23:51,280
Kaimook.

150
00:23:54,120 --> 00:23:55,000
Do you see?

151
00:23:56,680 --> 00:23:58,960
The door is open.

152
00:24:05,720 --> 00:24:06,920
Can you get up?

153
00:24:08,080 --> 00:24:09,040
Are you alright?

154
00:24:13,760 --> 00:24:14,640
Are you alright?

155
00:25:06,920 --> 00:25:08,040
Da.

156
00:25:09,440 --> 00:25:10,320
Are you okay?

157
00:25:22,360 --> 00:25:23,600
I'm scared!

158
00:25:30,280 --> 00:25:31,160
Are you hurt?

159
00:25:32,320 --> 00:25:33,280
No.

160
00:25:34,760 --> 00:25:35,600
Hurry up.

161
00:25:37,880 --> 00:25:38,760
Be careful.

162
00:25:51,240 --> 00:25:54,640
Everyone, jump before the ship goes under.

163
00:25:56,040 --> 00:25:57,080
Come on, Da.

164
00:26:03,240 --> 00:26:05,720
Come on. Come up here.

165
00:26:10,520 --> 00:26:14,000
Da, are you ready? You need to jump.

166
00:26:15,000 --> 00:26:16,080
Don't be afraid.

167
00:26:17,680 --> 00:26:18,640
Let's go.

168
00:26:21,080 --> 00:26:22,040
Kaimook.

169
00:26:23,240 --> 00:26:24,360
You need to jump.

170
00:26:25,200 --> 00:26:26,720
I'll go after you.

171
00:26:27,840 --> 00:26:28,720
Slowly.

172
00:26:29,520 --> 00:26:30,520
Be careful.

173
00:26:35,160 --> 00:26:36,320
What about you?

174
00:26:37,160 --> 00:26:38,720
I'll follow you.

175
00:26:39,840 --> 00:26:40,960
Go, Kaimook!

176
00:27:13,720 --> 00:27:14,640
Da.

177
00:27:26,200 --> 00:27:27,120
Mook.

178
00:27:33,720 --> 00:27:34,720
Mr. Phum.

179
00:27:56,120 --> 00:27:58,080
Why were you floating
in the middle of the sea?

180
00:28:05,200 --> 00:28:08,040
What about Thon? Where's Thon?

181
00:28:09,640 --> 00:28:12,000
Thon. Narathon.

182
00:28:12,760 --> 00:28:15,560
Don't tell me
he's still trapped inside the ship.

183
00:28:21,600 --> 00:28:23,360
Narathon's still on the ship.

184
00:28:25,400 --> 00:28:26,599
Over there.

185
00:28:26,600 --> 00:28:27,680
Thon!

186
00:28:34,760 --> 00:28:35,960
What ship?

187
00:28:46,920 --> 00:28:48,360
Narathon will make it.

188
00:31:14,360 --> 00:31:15,519
Mr. Narathon!

189
00:31:15,520 --> 00:31:16,720
Mr. Thon.

190
00:31:33,080 --> 00:31:34,360
Mr. Thon.

191
00:31:39,880 --> 00:31:40,840
Mr. Thon.

192
00:31:43,720 --> 00:31:44,560
Mr. Thon.

193
00:32:19,880 --> 00:32:20,920
Dad?

194
00:32:23,800 --> 00:32:24,840
Dad!

195
00:32:29,960 --> 00:32:31,000
Dad.

196
00:33:50,800 --> 00:33:53,079
My dear Kaimook.

197
00:33:53,080 --> 00:33:55,440
You look so beautiful, sweetheart.

198
00:33:57,520 --> 00:33:59,240
Thank you, Mom.

199
00:34:03,720 --> 00:34:05,919
Your idea is amazing.

200
00:34:05,920 --> 00:34:09,120
I'm going to tell Na
to have our wedding like this too.

201
00:34:10,960 --> 00:34:14,119
Then why don't we get married today too?

202
00:34:14,120 --> 00:34:15,280
Oh.

203
00:34:17,040 --> 00:34:20,599
Then I guess I'd have to
walk down the aisle in a swimsuit.

204
00:34:20,600 --> 00:34:21,999
I didn't bring a wedding dress.

205
00:34:22,000 --> 00:34:23,959
Oh, Da.

206
00:34:23,960 --> 00:34:25,999
Not a bad idea.

207
00:34:26,000 --> 00:34:28,599
It fits the beach theme.

208
00:34:28,600 --> 00:34:30,678
Might even be more stylish than Mook's.

209
00:34:30,679 --> 00:34:31,880
Right, Mom?

210
00:34:33,080 --> 00:34:36,158
Na, I was being sarcastic.

211
00:34:36,159 --> 00:34:37,600
Whoa.

212
00:34:41,920 --> 00:34:43,120
Please come in.

213
00:34:44,920 --> 00:34:47,279
Is the bride ready yet? The groom's ready.

214
00:34:47,280 --> 00:34:48,799
The bride's also ready.

215
00:34:48,800 --> 00:34:52,199
Then, Groom, please come in.

216
00:35:31,040 --> 00:35:33,639
Stop staring at each other
like fighting fish.

217
00:35:33,640 --> 00:35:36,080
Come on, Groom. Time to take your bride.

218
00:35:49,560 --> 00:35:52,319
Oh, are you all finished?

219
00:35:52,320 --> 00:35:57,200
Don't just keep talking.
The guests are already arriving.

220
00:35:58,280 --> 00:36:01,039
Well, where's Dad?

221
00:36:01,040 --> 00:36:03,400
He's not here?

222
00:36:05,040 --> 00:36:06,360
Where are Mr. Phum and Kang?

223
00:36:08,200 --> 00:36:10,159
They're probably at the beach.

224
00:36:10,160 --> 00:36:12,720
Every time they come here,

225
00:36:13,400 --> 00:36:16,000
Mr. Phum and Kang always
spend time sitting by the shore.

226
00:36:17,800 --> 00:36:21,280
They're probably visiting Sarai.
They'll be back soon.

227
00:36:24,320 --> 00:36:26,640
Alright. Let's get downstairs
and welcome the guests.

228
00:36:31,200 --> 00:36:32,200
Wait.

229
00:36:35,600 --> 00:36:40,120
I'm sorry I couldn't keep your ring.

230
00:36:58,040 --> 00:36:59,120
It's okay.

231
00:37:01,280 --> 00:37:03,600
We're about to become one, Kaimook.

232
00:37:10,280 --> 00:37:11,480
I promise

233
00:37:12,480 --> 00:37:13,680
to love you

234
00:37:14,640 --> 00:37:16,480
and take care of you
for the rest of my life.

235
00:37:21,120 --> 00:37:23,000
Me too.

236
00:37:23,880 --> 00:37:27,560
I promise to be the best wife
for the rest of my life.

237
00:37:50,560 --> 00:37:53,240
Save that kiss for tonight, Mr. Narathon.

238
00:37:55,680 --> 00:37:58,680
Right now, you'd better get downstairs
and welcome the guests.

239
00:37:59,600 --> 00:38:01,360
You still have plenty of time.

240
00:38:05,240 --> 00:38:07,080
She always has the worst timing.

241
00:40:15,560 --> 00:40:16,640
Dad,

242
00:40:18,120 --> 00:40:19,480
I miss Mom.

243
00:40:23,040 --> 00:40:25,640
What's Mom doing right now?

244
00:40:32,400 --> 00:40:35,200
She's probably
watching over us from heaven.

245
00:40:38,640 --> 00:40:39,880
I want to meet her.

246
00:40:45,440 --> 00:40:47,080
If you want to see her again,

247
00:40:47,840 --> 00:40:51,159
you have to be a good boy and study hard.

248
00:40:51,160 --> 00:40:53,400
One day, you'll see her again.

249
00:40:54,200 --> 00:40:55,440
Yes, Dad.

250
00:41:02,760 --> 00:41:04,000
Mom!

251
00:41:05,000 --> 00:41:10,120
I promise I'll be a good boy.
I'll study hard.

252
00:41:10,840 --> 00:41:12,440
Please wait for me.

253
00:41:13,400 --> 00:41:14,920
I love you, Mom.

254
00:41:20,560 --> 00:41:21,560
Sarai,

255
00:41:23,200 --> 00:41:25,040
we miss you.

256
00:41:28,400 --> 00:41:29,920
Rest peacefully.

257
00:41:31,040 --> 00:41:32,320
Don't worry about Kang.

258
00:41:34,000 --> 00:41:36,520
I'll take the best care of him.

259
00:41:38,840 --> 00:41:40,200
One day,

260
00:41:42,000 --> 00:41:43,200
we'll finally meet again.

261
00:41:53,040 --> 00:41:54,000
Come on.

262
00:41:55,000 --> 00:41:57,000
Let's go to the wedding.

263
00:41:57,600 --> 00:41:58,520
Yes, Dad.

264
00:42:07,040 --> 00:42:13,080
THE END

265
00:42:51,920 --> 00:42:53,400
Subtitle translation by: Panuwat Baikeawon
